{"description":"std-github \u2014 the GitHub REST API (api.github.com) as one atom: open a pull request, list a pull request's review comments, list and read issues, open an issue, read a file at a ref and list commits. Requests are authenticated with the GitHub token knob and carry the 2022-11-28 API version. A non-2xx reply answers the action's failure event with GitHub's code (RATE_LIMIT_ERROR for 429, AUTH_ERROR for 401/403, SERVICE_ERROR otherwise) and message; an unreachable API answers NETWORK_ERROR. The git CLI actions (clone, branch, commit, push) are local processes, not HTTP, and are not part of this atom.","egress":["https://api.github.com"],"ledger":{"entries":{"ent_PCTV1RM4AR25C62VFYJ56MY01R":{"bakedName":"GithubCall","curName":"GithubCall","id":"ent_PCTV1RM4AR25C62VFYJ56MY01R","kind":"entity","owner":"workspace","renames":[]},"evt_0TYSWYM4BG25R9M2V6QPMJGG64":{"bakedName":"GITHUB_GET_ISSUE_FAILED","curName":"GITHUB_GET_ISSUE_FAILED","id":"evt_0TYSWYM4BG25R9M2V6QPMJGG64","kind":"event","owner":"workspace","parent":"trt_49ZYKB25382HMF5QFR2WCZ8VMR","renames":[]},"evt_2MBZC5P0V70DKN7QSH6M02SYXH":{"bakedName":"GITHUB_GET_PR_COMMENTS_FAILED","curName":"GITHUB_GET_PR_COMMENTS_FAILED","id":"evt_2MBZC5P0V70DKN7QSH6M02SYXH","kind":"event","owner":"workspace","parent":"trt_49ZYKB25382HMF5QFR2WCZ8VMR","renames":[]},"evt_3TT4HVQZBBZNNWHWJGNVW3TRT8":{"bakedName":"GITHUB_CREATE_ISSUE_UNREACHABLE","curName":"GITHUB_CREATE_ISSUE_UNREACHABLE","id":"evt_3TT4HVQZBBZNNWHWJGNVW3TRT8","kind":"event","owner":"workspace","parent":"trt_49ZYKB25382HMF5QFR2WCZ8VMR","renames":[]},"evt_3YP5M9PNE2AQ1BND5JTD63CZYK":{"bakedName":"GITHUB_LIST_COMMITS_REPLIED","curName":"GITHUB_LIST_COMMITS_REPLIED","id":"evt_3YP5M9PNE2AQ1BND5JTD63CZYK","kind":"event","owner":"workspace","parent":"trt_49ZYKB25382HMF5QFR2WCZ8VMR","renames":[]},"evt_4W4BFX1767KK3PZ0T5ZDQ88MTE":{"bakedName":"GITHUB_GET_PR_COMMENTS_REPLIED","curName":"GITHUB_GET_PR_COMMENTS_REPLIED","id":"evt_4W4BFX1767KK3PZ0T5ZDQ88MTE","ki